, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2-2025", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 11735, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Srp8Lm5h7hhvYaWZgGWQkc", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 13312, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions and opened a SEV2 incident (INC-0001), which paged on-call.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.1 was unhealthy in production, and v2.3.0 was the most recent production release that was healthy. v2.3.1-rc was only deployed to staging, so I didn't use it. After the rollback, us-east, us-west and eu-west all run v2.3.0. The service reports healthy with an error rate of 0.002, down from 0.18.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open at SEV2. The summary covers the failure, the rollback and its verification, and a note that v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until its root cause is found.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll check the release history and current status for checkout-api first.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01KQeH14i8fHfExXNba6iEPC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_012zRYe2dACAz8Khshyfo8kW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0 (seq 1). v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging. I'll roll back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01XJdRboixZCZC1SQQiwGCPc", "